{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>תסמר</b> — it will terrify, like: סמר מפחדך בשרי (my flesh bristles from your fear). And Rabbenu Hai of blessed memory interpreted: that it is from ממסמרות, for pain is like a planted nail." "<b>יחלוף</b> — it will pass, like חלף הלך לו (he passed on his way)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:43.667587962Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}